       "prompt": "טבלת גיבוב בגודל $m=7$ עם $h(k)=k \\bmod 7$. באיזה תא יושב המפתח $23$ ?",
       "answer": 2,
       "tol": 0,
       "explain": "$23 = 3\\cdot 7 + 2$, ולכן $23 \\bmod 7 = 2$.",
       "promptHtml": "טבלת גיבוב בגודל <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m=7</annotation></semantics></math></span> עם <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>k</mi><mtext> </mtext><mo lspace=\"0.22em\" rspace=\"0.22em\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow></mo><mtext> </mtext><mn>7</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h(k)=k \\bmod 7</annotation></semantics></math></span>. באיזה תא יושב המפתח <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>23</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">23</annotation></semantics></math></span> ?",
       "explainHtml": "<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>23</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">23 = 3\\cdot 7 + 2</annotation></semantics></math></span>, ולכן <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>23</mn><mtext> </mtext><mo lspace=\"0.22em\" rspace=\"0.22em\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow></mo><mtext> </mtext><mn>7</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">23 \\bmod 7 = 2</annotation></semantics></math></span>."
