       "promptHtml": "טבלה בגודל <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m=7</annotation></semantics></math></span> עם <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>k</mi><mtext> </mtext><mo lspace=\"0.22em\" rspace=\"0.22em\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow></mo><mtext> </mtext><mn>7</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h(k)=k \\bmod 7</annotation></semantics></math></span>. מכניסים את המפתחות <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>12</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>19</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>25</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>33</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>40</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>47</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">12, 19, 25, 33, 40, 47</annotation></semantics></math></span>. כמה מהם מגיעים לתא <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">5</annotation></semantics></math></span> ?",
       "explainHtml": "השאריות בחלוקה ב-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>7</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">7</annotation></semantics></math></span> הן <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>5</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>4</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>5</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>5</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">5, 5, 4, 5, 5, 5</annotation></semantics></math></span>. רק <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>25</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">25</annotation></semantics></math></span> מגיע לתא <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">4</annotation></semantics></math></span>, והשאר, חמישה מפתחות, מגיעים לתא <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">5</annotation></semantics></math></span>."
