      "explanationHtml": "הצעד <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>k</mi><mtext> </mtext><mo lspace=\"0.22em\" rspace=\"0.22em\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow></mo><mtext> </mtext><mn>9</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1+(k\\bmod 9)</annotation></semantics></math></span> נע בין <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1</annotation></semantics></math></span> ל-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>9</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">9</annotation></semantics></math></span>, אף פעם לא <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0</annotation></semantics></math></span>, וכל מספר כזה זר ל-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>11</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">11</annotation></semantics></math></span> (ראשוני), ולכן כל סדרה עוברת על כל <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>11</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">11</annotation></semantics></math></span> התאים. הצעד <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi><mtext> </mtext><mo lspace=\"0.22em\" rspace=\"0.22em\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow></mo><mtext> </mtext><mn>9</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k\\bmod 9</annotation></semantics></math></span> הוא <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0</annotation></semantics></math></span> כשמתחלקים ב-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>9</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">9</annotation></semantics></math></span> (למשל <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k=9</annotation></semantics></math></span>). הצעד <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi><mtext> </mtext><mo lspace=\"0.22em\" rspace=\"0.22em\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow></mo><mtext> </mtext><mn>11</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k\\bmod 11</annotation></semantics></math></span> הוא <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0</annotation></semantics></math></span> כשמתחלקים ב-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>11</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">11</annotation></semantics></math></span>. ו-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>random</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{random}</annotation></semantics></math></span> אינה דטרמיניסטית ולכן החיפוש לא ימצא את המפתח.",
