      "explanationHtml": "<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msub><mn>7</mn><mo>≈</mo><mn>2.807</mn><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\log_2 7\\approx2.807&gt;2</annotation></semantics></math></span>, הרף <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>n</mi><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msub><mn>7</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n^{\\log_2 7}</annotation></semantics></math></span> גדול מ-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(n)=n^2</annotation></semantics></math></span> בחזקה, ולכן מקרה 1: <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Θ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>n</mi><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msub><mn>7</mn></mrow></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Theta(n^{\\log_2 7})</annotation></semantics></math></span> (זה אלגוריתם שטראסן). <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n^2</annotation></semantics></math></span> ו-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n^2\\log n</annotation></semantics></math></span> מתעלמים מהעלים. <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n^3</annotation></semantics></math></span> הוא חזקה שלמה גדולה מדי: <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2.807</mn><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2.807&lt;3</annotation></semantics></math></span>.",
