      "correctId": "d",
      "explanation": "$a=1$, $b=4$, $\\log_4 1=0$, הרף הוא $n^0=1$. $f(n)=1024=\\Theta(1)$ שווה לרף, ולכן מקרה 2: $\\Theta(1\\cdot\\log n)=\\Theta(\\log n)$. $\\Theta(1)$ שוכח את גורם ה-$\\log$ של מקרה 2. הקבוע $1024$ לא משנה את הסדר.",
      "recap": "$f$ קבועה ו-$a=1$: מקרה 2, $\\Theta(\\log n)$",
      "questionHtml": "פתרו: <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>T</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>4</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>1024</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T(n)=T(n/4)+1024</annotation></semantics></math></span>.",
      "explanationHtml": "<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a=1</annotation></semantics></math></span>, <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b=4</annotation></semantics></math></span>, <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>4</mn></msub><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\log_4 1=0</annotation></semantics></math></span>, הרף הוא <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>0</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n^0=1</annotation></semantics></math></span>. <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>1024</mn><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Θ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(n)=1024=\\Theta(1)</annotation></semantics></math></span> שווה לרף, ולכן מקרה 2: <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Θ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Θ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Theta(1\\cdot\\log n)=\\Theta(\\log n)</annotation></semantics></math></span>. <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Θ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Theta(1)</annotation></semantics></math></span> שוכח את גורם ה-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\log</annotation></semantics></math></span> של מקרה 2. הקבוע <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1024</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1024</annotation></semantics></math></span> לא משנה את הסדר.",
      "recapHtml": "<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f</annotation></semantics></math></span> קבועה ו-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a=1</annotation></semantics></math></span>: מקרה 2, <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Θ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Theta(\\log n)</annotation></semantics></math></span>"
